@startuml
title FR-22 - View Saved Forecast - Activity Diagram

|Blood Bank Administrator|
start
:Request saved forecasts;

|Server — Analytics & AI|
:Determine the administrator's permitted forecast scope;
:Retrieve the saved forecast list within that scope;

if (Forecast list retrieved successfully?) then (Yes)
  if (Saved forecasts exist within scope?) then (Yes)
    |Client|
    :Display the available saved forecasts;

    |Blood Bank Administrator|
    :Select a saved forecast;

    |Server — Analytics & AI|
    :Determine the administrator's current permitted scope;
    :Retrieve the selected forecast's saved result\nand identifying information using\nits identifier and the current scope;

    if (Requested forecast retrieved within current scope?) then (Yes)
      |Client|
      :Display the selected saved forecast's\ncomponent, ABO/Rh group, scope,\nresults and identifying information;
      stop

    else (Missing, out of scope or retrieval failed)
      |Client|
      :Clear any previously displayed forecast;
      :Explain that the selected forecast cannot be displayed;
      stop
    endif

  else (No)
    |Client|
    :Display no saved forecast results;
    stop
  endif

else (No)
  |Client|
  :Report that the saved forecast list could not be loaded;
  stop
endif

@enduml